            "carried_forward_from": "evidence/pr-review/4431/7061eb6dd16c550bb496708e376d3031a9f18ff1/findings.sarif",
            "failure_scenario": "A caller resolves the binding's declared path aprender::tree::helpers::compute_mse expecting a public implemented function; that path does not exist (real fn is pub(super) under tree::regression_helpers), so any generated binding or doc built from this contract entry fails to compile or silently points nowhere."
